<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE-Roly net profit down 52.9 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Roly net profit down 52.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 30, 1997</p>
<p>		    (in millions of US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  7.75    vs     16.44</p>
<p>    Dividend (cts)	    0.50    vs	0.50</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)	 2.40    vs	6.10</p>
<p>    Turnover		  247.19    vs    238.33</p>
<p>    Other income		2.35    vs	1.35</p>
<p>    Interest expense	  5.92    vs	6.68</p>
<p>    Depreciation		3.93    vs	3.09</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    9.30    vs     20.22</p>
<p>    Tax			   1.40    vs	3.62</p>
<p>    Minorities		 (0.15)   vs     (0.16)</p>
<p>Note - Roly International Holdings Ltd is a diversified home and decor and consumer products company.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703088)</p>
</text>
